Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 03:28:45 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] release: v0.1.3.1 README, CHANGELOG, run docs and the re-gate
 receipts

README.md is the v0.1.3.1 page. CHANGELOG.md gains the v0.1.3.1 section above v0.1.3.0. docs/arifi/ gains HOW-WE-RUN.md, ENVIRONMENT.md and WINDOWS-SETTINGS.md, the current Windows native NVMe guide, and a STATUS.md pointer to the new receipts. evidence/v0.1.3.1/ carries the re-gate receipts against v0.1.3.0 with sha256 in its MANIFEST.md. docs/BUILDING.md states the web UI is built in and how to turn it off; the MTP sidecar README explains its quality and speed. NOTICE, licences, STATUS, the v0.1.3.0 receipts and release notes are carried from the published v0.1.3.0 branch; the banner shows v0.1.3.1.

Origin: ArifiLabs (native) - release documentation for this fork; no upstream origin exists.
Measured-effect: UNMEASURED - documents and receipts only; no code path is touched.
